    "Document::displayCalibration uses one current whole-plane Application target in a private cache. Existing validate_target refreshes on source pixels/metadata, own bypass or relevant global changes. Navigation and selection are not calibration dependencies. Ignored documents survive unrelated global/bypass changes. No new generation grammar or per-frame record/table decoding.",
