    "displaySpacing uses captured geometry and existing direction-column norms. Ordinary canvas aspect and hover world values, OrthogonalViews geometry/world captions and headless world diagnostics use the view-specific input. Fit/zoom call sites inherit displaySpacing; effective fit-selection variants remain separately unqualified.",
    "spatialCalibration, document-info local calibration/time fields and persistence remain local. Additive document-info display_calibration reports effective spatial values/world coordinates and cache build diagnostics. No source mutation or Global/bypass controls introduced."
